    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 24,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Whew...!",
      "translation" : "呼...！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Still, he won't eat anything unless it's Meat. But maybe he will eat fruit if it was cut so that it was easy to eat. Like, if it was blended into juice...",
      "translation" : "可是除了肉，他什麼都不肯吃。也許把水果切得容易入口些，他就會吃了。比如榨成果汁..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Housewife Marianne]",
      "translation" : "[家庭主婦瑪麗安娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ah! Come to think of it, I heard they were making fruit juice somewhere. Now where was it... Payon Village, or Morocc?",
      "translation" : "啊！說起來，我聽說有個地方在做果汁。在哪裡來著...斐揚村，還是夢羅克？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Housewife Marianne]",
      "translation" : "[家庭主婦瑪麗安娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Morrison!! Eat some fruits!! You don't want to become a slobby fat pig when you grow up, do you?",
      "translation" : "莫里森！！吃點水果！！你長大後不想變成又懶又胖的豬吧？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Talk",
      "translation" : "交談"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Cancel",
      "translation" : "取消"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Housewife Marianne]",
      "translation" : "[家庭主婦瑪麗安娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hm? ...You!",
      "translation" : "嗯？...是你！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You're the one who gave, my little Morrison that Meat?! Did you come here thinking I wouldn't know about it?!",
      "translation" : "是你給我家小莫里森肉吃的？！你以為我不知道就跑來了嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Housewife Marianne]",
      "translation" : "[家庭主婦瑪麗安娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Go away, get out of my house NOW!!",
      "translation" : "快走，現在就從我家出去！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Housewife Marianne]",
      "translation" : "[家庭主婦瑪麗安娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Morrison!! I'm going to be very very mad if you keep doing this!",
      "translation" : "莫里森！！你要是再這樣，我真的會非常生氣！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Housewife Marianne]",
      "translation" : "[家庭主婦瑪麗安娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh!!.... This...",
      "translation" : "哦！！...這是..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "what is this...??",
      "translation" : "什麼東西...？？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "How could you do something like this to my boy?!",
      "translation" : "你怎麼能對我的孩子做這種事？！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Housewife Marianne]",
      "translation" : "[家庭主婦瑪麗安娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Argh! Get out of my house right this instant!",
      "translation" : "啊！馬上給我滾出我家！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Housewife Marianne]",
      "translation" : "[家庭主婦瑪麗安娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Morrison!! Please eat some fruits!! Please~!",
      "translation" : "莫里森！！求你吃點水果吧！！拜託了~！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Housewife Marinaa]",
      "translation" : "[家庭主婦瑪麗安娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sigh~!! Like father, like son...",
      "translation" : "唉~！有其父必有其子..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Talk",
      "translation" : "交談"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Cancel",
      "translation" : "取消"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Housewife Marianne]",
      "translation" : "[家庭主婦瑪麗安娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "*Sigh*... This is Morrison...",
      "translation" : "*嘆氣*...這是莫里森..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "My one and only son.",
      "translation" : "我唯一的兒子。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Housewife Marianne]",
      "translation" : "[家庭主婦瑪麗安娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But these days, he just won't eat fruits. His face is so dull because he refuses to eat healthy. He just wants to eat Meat. I need to find a way to feed him fruits or vegetables....",
      "translation" : "可是最近他就是不肯吃水果。不肯健康飲食，臉色也變得很差。他只想吃肉。我得想辦法讓他吃些水果或蔬菜..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Housewife Marianne]",
      "translation" : "[家庭主婦瑪麗安娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Morrison!! You're going to be in big trouble if you keep this up!",
      "translation" : "莫里森！！你再這樣下去就要倒大黴了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Morrison",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Little Morrison]",
      "translation" : "[小莫里森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Morrison",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Bleh... Forget it.",
      "translation" : "呸...算了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Morrison",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm just going to shrivel to death just eating fruits. Don't bother worrying about me .",
      "translation" : "光吃水果我會餓死的。別管我。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Morrison",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Little Morrison]",
      "translation" : "[小莫里森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Morrison",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ah... so full~",
      "translation" : "啊...好飽~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 92,
      "npc" : "Morrison",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I think I can live now.",
      "translation" : "我感覺我又能活下去了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Morrison",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You don't have to give me any more Meat. I feel like I'm going to explode if I eat any more.",
      "translation" : "不用再給我肉了。再吃下去我感覺要撐爆了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Morrison",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Little Morrison]",
      "translation" : "[小莫里森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Morrison",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh... and... um.",
      "translation" : "哦...還有...那個。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Morrison",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Take this.",
      "translation" : "拿著這個。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Morrison",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Little Morrison]",
      "translation" : "[小莫里森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Morrison",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's a little something I've been saving to eat for later, but since you gave me Meat, I think I can pass on the sweets.",
      "translation" : "這是我留著以後吃的小零食，不過你給了我肉，我想甜食就讓給你吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Morrison",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Little Morrison]",
      "translation" : "[小莫里森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Morrison",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Agh....Noooo!!!",
      "translation" : "啊...不要！！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Morrison",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No, don't make me eat it! I can't bear to taste fruits!",
      "translation" : "不，別逼我吃！我受不了水果的味道！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Morrison",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Talk",
      "translation" : "交談"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Morrison",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Show the Meat",
      "translation" : "拿出肉"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Morrison",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Cancel",
      "translation" : "取消"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Morrison",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Little Morrison]",
      "translation" : "[小莫里森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Morrison",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Aaaagh!! Once or twice is enough!! I refuse to eat any more fruits! You have to peel them and there's so much juice that it makes you feel icky...",
      "translation" : "啊啊啊！！一兩次就夠了！！我再也不吃水果了！還得剝皮，而且汁水太多，感覺黏糊糊的..."
