      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Morrison",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Little Morrison]",
      "translation" : "[小莫里森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Morrison",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "And they're all slippery and sour... Even if I eat it, I still feel hungry. Aaaah~! Give me Meat!",
      "translation" : "而且又滑又酸...吃了還是覺得餓。啊啊~！給我肉！"
